#: src/library/ClientFence/Mail.php
msgid "ClientFence requires the proc_open and escapeshellarg PHP functions to be enabled when using the sendmail transport"
msgstr "כדי להשתמש בהעברת דוא״ל באמצעות sendmail, יש להפעיל ב-ClientFence את פונקציות PHP proc_open ו-escapeshellarg"

#: src/modules/Email/templates/admin/mod_email_settings.html.twig
msgid "ClientFence sends email using Sendmail by default, or you can configure SMTP, SendGrid, or a custom Symfony mailer DSN."
